      <div  class="field-detailed-description"><div class="tex2jax_process"><p>The aftershock sequence of the magnitude 7 earthquake that struck Haiti on Jan. 12, 2010, will continue for months, if not years. The frequency of events will diminish with time, but damaging earthquakes will remain a threat.</p></div></div>
  
</div>

